            </summary>
            <p class="text-slate-700 mt-4 ml-8">These Terms are governed by U.S. law. If any provision conflicts with local laws, that provision may be unenforceable in your jurisdiction, but others remain valid.</p>
          </details>

          <details class="bg-[#F8F6F4] rounded-xl p-6 cursor-pointer group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="text-lg text-[#1B5E3F]">+</span>
              How often do you update these Terms?
            </summary>
            <p class="text-slate-700 mt-4 ml-8">We update Terms as needed to reflect changes in our Website and services. The "Last Updated" date shows when we last modified them. Check back periodically for changes.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Related Links -->
      <div class="mt-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#1A1A1A] mb-8">Other Legal Documents</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <a href="/privacy-policy" class="bg-[#F8F6F4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#F3E8EA] hover:border-[#1B5E3F] hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
            <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🔒</p>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#1B5E3F] transition-colors">Privacy Policy</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">How we collect, use, and protect your data</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/contact" class="bg-[#F8F6F4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#F3E8EA] hover:border-[#1B5E3F] hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
            <p class="text-2xl mb-2">💬</p>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#1B5E3F] transition-colors">Contact Us</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Questions about our Terms? Get in touch</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/about-us" class="bg-[#F8F6F4] p-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#F3E8EA] hover:border-[#1B5E3F] hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
            <p class="text-2xl mb-2">💚</p>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#1B5E3F] transition-colors">About Us</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">Learn about Wedding Planning Checklists</p>
          </a>
